Yaw
 rotation left/right
 around the Y axis
 changes where the camera is facing horizontally
Pitch
 rotation up/down
 around the X axis
 changes vertical view
 must be clamped (to avoid flipping)

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
float mx = Input.GetAxisRaw("Mouse X") * sensitivity;
float my = Input.GetAxisRaw("Mouse Y") * sensitivity;
yaw += mx;
pitch -= my;   // minus = correct “FPS” style look
transform.rotation = Quaternion.Euler(pitch, yaw, 0f);
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
        Pitch ↑ 
            |
Yaw ←   Camera   → Yaw →
            |
        Pitch ↓

